1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:07,134
The Tehran Stock Exchange. Every day: thousands of symbols, millions of numbers.

2
00:00:07,534 --> 00:00:12,007
Now ask an AI: what's today's buy queue?

3
00:00:12,307 --> 00:00:15,420
The answer? I don't have access.

4
00:00:16,320 --> 00:00:18,771
Iran Bourse MCP.

5
00:00:19,020 --> 00:00:23,658
The Tehran exchange, right inside your AI assistant.

6
00:00:24,270 --> 00:00:29,163
The same question; this time, a real answer. In one call.

7
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:37,676
Sharper: every single Foolad trade, from 10:00 to 10:01.

8
00:00:38,526 --> 00:00:44,471
With time, price and volume; it even points out the biggest trade.

9
00:00:45,270 --> 00:00:48,054
And now, the hard one.

10
00:00:48,820 --> 00:00:54,711
Stocks whose volume doubled its average, that rose yesterday, and are up today too.

11
00:00:55,111 --> 00:00:57,707
The agent writes the filter itself.

12
00:00:59,370 --> 00:01:04,288
Of 625 shares, only 35 meet every condition.

13
00:01:05,220 --> 00:01:10,749
Without MCP: 22 requests, and 7 million tokens of raw data.

14
00:01:11,020 --> 00:01:15,920
With MCP: one call, and just 723 tokens.

15
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:19,008
Ten thousand times fewer.

16
00:01:19,670 --> 00:01:21,869
And that's just the start.

17
00:01:22,270 --> 00:01:24,093
Options.

18
00:01:24,120 --> 00:01:26,100
Index history.

19
00:01:26,120 --> 00:01:28,508
Capital-increase calendar.

20
00:01:28,620 --> 00:01:30,810
Fund rankings.

21
00:01:30,870 --> 00:01:32,799
Halted symbols.

22
00:01:32,870 --> 00:01:34,954
And top lists.

23
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:37,500
Forty tools.

24
00:01:37,520 --> 00:01:41,425
Read-only, open source, and free.

25
00:01:42,320 --> 00:01:45,879
On seventeen assistants; installed with one command.

26
00:01:47,970 --> 00:01:50,117
Iran Bourse MCP.

27
